<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Order Approval</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #1a73e8;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      background-color: #1a73e8;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #888;
    }
    .summary {
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 10px;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>New Rental Order Awaiting Your Approval</h2>
    <p>Hello <strong>{{curatorName}}</strong>,</p>
    <p>You have received a new rental order for one or more of your products.</p>

    <div class="summary">
      <p><strong>Order ID:</strong> {{orderId}}</p>
      <p><strong>Number of Items:</strong> {{itemCount}}</p>
      <p><strong>Rental Period:</strong> {{rentalPeriod}}</p>
    </div>

    <p>Please review the order details in your dashboard and confirm availability within <strong>30 minutes</strong> to proceed with the rental.</p>
    <p>Once approved:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Products will be reserved for the renter.</li>
      <li>Funds will be securely held in escrow.</li>
      <li>You will be notified when the rental is completed and funds become withdrawable.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>If you are unable to fulfill this order, you may reject it within the approval window.</p>

    <a href="{{approvalLink}}" class="btn">Review & Approve Order</a>

    <p class="footer">
      Thank you for being a valued curator on our platform.<br>
      The {{platformName}} Team
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
